  "messageType": "215",
  "name": "Motor Carrier Pick-up Manifest",
  "description": "This Draft Standard for Trial Use contains the format and establishes the data contents of the Motor Carrier Pick-up Manifest Transaction Set (215) for use within the context of an Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) environment. This transaction set can be used to allow shippers, or other parties, to provide a motor carrier with a manifest of all of the shipments tendered to a carrier. It is not to be used to provide a motor carrier with data relative to a load tender, legal bill of lading, pick-up notification, or appointment scheduling.",
